                <pb facs="0756" n="646" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg646"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ryan to Mr.
                            Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-07-27"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 27, 1890</date>.
                        (Received July 29.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Ryan reports, in reply to instructions regarding inviolability of
                    correspondence, that Salvador seems responsible, and that he has demanded of her
                    special agent in Mexico that the rights of the United States be guarantied.</p>
            </div>
